# The tree `make docs` builds.
/dist/

# The credentials .envrc loads. .envrc.private.example lists them.
.envrc.private

# The cache mounts that an images job copies out of a build and saves.
# ci/templates/component.yaml.tmpl gives the steps.
/.image-cache/

# The published bases that `make bases` checked. What it holds depends
# on the registry when it ran, so each workstation and each CI run
# writes its own. ci/bases.go gives the checks.
/docker-bake.override.hcl
